      "english": "Monkey Year Horse Month"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "猴年马月是一个成语，一般指很久很久以前或以后，不知道什么时候。",
      "traditional": "猴年馬月是一個成語，一般指很久很久以前或以後，不知道什麼時候。",
      "pinyin": "hóu nián mǎ yuè shì yí ge chéng yǔ yì bān zhǐ hěn jiǔ hěn jiǔ yǐ qián huò yǐ hòu bù zhī dào shén me shí hou",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "也用来指一件事情不太可能完成。",
      "traditional": "也用來指一件事情不太可能完成。",
      "pinyin": "yě yòng lái zhǐ yí jiàn shì qing bú tài kě néng wán chéng",
      "english": "“Monkey Year Horse Month” is a proverb which usually refers to an unknown point in time long before or after now."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "你可以这么用，“这都是猴年马月的事情了，你竟然还记得”，",
      "traditional": "你可以這麼用，“這都是猴年馬月的事情了，你竟然還記得”，",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kě yǐ zhè me yòng zhè dōu shì hóu nián mǎ yuè de shì qing le nǐ jìng rán hái jì de",
      "english": "It is also used to refer to something that is unlikely to ever complete."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "或者如果有人问你什么时候能和他约会，而你不想去，那么你就可以这么回答：",
      "traditional": "或者如果有人問你什麼時候能和他約會，而你不想去，那麼你就可以這麼回答：",
      "pinyin": "huò zhě rú guǒ yǒu rén wèn nǐ shén me shí hou néng hé tā yuē huì ér nǐ bù xiǎng qù nà me nǐ jiù kě yǐ zhè me huí dá",
      "english": "You can use it like this: “These things all happened a long time ago, how come you still remember?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“等到猴年马月吧。”",
      "traditional": "“等到猴年馬月吧。”",
      "pinyin": "děng dào hóu nián mǎ yuè ba",
      "english": "Or if someone asks you when you can go on a date with him but you don't want to go, then you can reply like this:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "那个人应该就知道你不想和他约会了。",
      "traditional": "那個人應該就知道你不想和他約會了。",
      "pinyin": "nà ge rén yīng gāi jiù zhī dào nǐ bù xiǎng hé tā yuē huì le",
      "english": "“When Hell freezes over.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That person will surely understand that you do not want to date him."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "但是，最近这个成语可不能乱用，因为猴年马月马上就要到了。",
      "traditional": "但是，最近這個成語可不能亂用，因為猴年馬月馬上就要到了。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì zuì jìn zhè ge chéng yǔ kě bù néng luàn yòng yīn wèi hóu nián mǎ yuè mǎ shàng jiù yào dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "大家都知道，今年2016年是猴年，而6月5号到7月3号是马月，",
      "traditional": "大家都知道，今年2016年是猴年，而6月5號到7月3號是馬月，",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā dōu zhī dào jīn nián 4 nián shì hóu nián ér 1 yuè 1 hào dào 1 yuè 1 hào shì mǎ yuè",
      "english": "Lately however, you must use this proverb with care, because Monkey Year Horse Month is about to arrive."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "所以2016年6月5号到7月3号就是猴年马月了。",
      "traditional": "所以2016年6月5號到7月3號就是猴年馬月了。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ 4 nián 1 yuè 1 hào dào 1 yuè 1 hào jiù shì hóu nián mǎ yuè le",
      "english": "Everyone knows that this year 2016 is the Year of the Monkey, and from June 5th to July 3rd is is the Month of the Horse."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "如果你说了“等到猴年马月就和你约会”，那就要小心啦。",
      "traditional": "如果你說了“等到猴年馬月就和你約會”，那就要小心啦。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ shuō le děng dào hóu nián mǎ yuè jiù hé nǐ yuē huì nà jiù yào xiǎo xīn la",
      "english": "So from June 5th to July 3rd 2016 it is Monkey Year Horse Month."
    }
  ],
